    "narrative": {
      "type": "Text",
      "props": {
        "text": "Between 13:21 and 13:58 UTC today, aaronjmars drained the open-PR queue on aaronjmars/aeon from eighteen to zero. He personally authored exactly one of those eighteen — a four-line registry edit. The other seventeen came from his own autonomous agent (three PRs opened over the weekend), a five-day-old account named houndflow (seven onchain skills), one bot, and four external humans. Repo ended the day at 472⭐ / 147 forks / 0 open issues / 0 open PRs, with skills.json grown from 171 to 179.",
        "variant": "body"
      }
    },
